{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","莱卡"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名擅长破环敌人护甲的射手，并且可以提升友军输出能力。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","迷路了吗？请跟上我"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Are you lost? Follow me."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","星辰愈发闪耀了"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","The stars sparkle ever more brilliantly."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","星光啊，照耀吧"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Shine, stars."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","流星终将坠落……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","...The meteor... will eventually... fall..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","群星引导着胜利"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","The constellations guide us to victory."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","一起观赏星光吧"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","早上好。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","今天又要并肩作战了。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","痒吗？没事了。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","你怎么知道我会喜欢这个？难道这是星辰的指引？！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","我没用过这种东西……如果有机会，我会试试的。谢谢你！"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","驭星猎手"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","弓弦指向的不仅是猎物，还有她注定要抵达的前方。"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","深林春晓"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","森林用繁花、新叶和一场春天为她送上新装。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","绮梦寻珍活动剧情获得。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","精英"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","难得休息一会儿……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","喝完这杯就去巡逻吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","有什么新口味？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","看，这是雪灯树"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我准备了很多礼物！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","好漂亮的彩缎啊！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我准备了很漂亮的灯！"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","薄暮丛林里几乎没有谁会讨厌莱卡，除了个别被她亲手拉弓对准的人。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","莱卡和谁都能成为朋友，连鸟兽都会主动亲近她，这常令同行的埃隆有些艳羡。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","芙拉贝尔曾试图邀请莱卡共同编写一本教材：《说话的艺术》。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","“莱卡队长一整天都愁眉不展，我猜昨夜的星象显示了不好的运势。”有人曾听到薄暮巡游队的队员这样说。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","“莱卡什么都好，就是对既定的命运太相信了，如果星象显示她做不成一件事，她就会放弃尝试。”——芙拉贝尔"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","莱卡知道自己所有队员喜欢的食物口味。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","除了看星象，莱卡还会通过茶水中茶叶的浮沉判断一天的运势好坏。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","在翡湖学院就读期间，有同学向莱卡请教了比赛获胜的秘诀，莱卡的答复是：只参加有把握获胜的比赛。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","莱卡毕业时，收到了许多同学的感谢信。每一封她都认真地回复了。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","“曾经有个外来的流民说她是个看上去没什么本事的小姑娘，队长她……一箭把那个人的耳坠射断了。”一名新进巡游队队员心有余悸地说。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","嗯……这么多花草，哪些泡茶会好一点呢……"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415011.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","莱卡 & 帕瑞莎"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","啊，是……是<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>…………您好，谢谢您的招待。"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415026.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","伊温 & 莱卡"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","嗯，蔬菜和草药你基本都认识，特殊的果实你也学过了……"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415035.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","莱卡 & 五月"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","难得休息一会儿……"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415114.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","莱卡"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","有什么新口味？"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415115.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","莱卡"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","隆冬节快到了，真怀念呀。"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415343.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","塔西 & 莱卡"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","看，这是雪灯树"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415423.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","莱卡"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","我准备了很多礼物！"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415424.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","莱卡"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","这儿真是个好地方，要是再来点音乐就更好了。"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415479.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 莱卡"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","好漂亮的彩缎啊！"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415597.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","莱卡"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","我准备了很漂亮的灯！"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415598.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","莱卡"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","没想到，我们好不容易再见面，却是在这样的情况下……"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412030.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","帕瑞莎 & 莱卡 & 卡夫拉"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/cn","好像有什么奇怪的声音，洛桑，你能听到吗？"],["/interaction_records/12/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412070.json"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/cn","莱卡 & 洛桑"],["/interaction_records/13/preview_i18n/cn","莱卡，你今天准备的食物有点多吧？"],["/interaction_records/13/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412100.json"],["/interaction_records/13/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 莱卡"],["/interaction_records/14/preview_i18n/cn","说起来，我们三个真是难得聚在一起。"],["/interaction_records/14/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412110.json"],["/interaction_records/14/title_i18n/cn","莱卡 & 埃隆 & 帕瑞莎"],["/interaction_records/15/preview_i18n/cn","无论看到多少次，卡夫拉这把大剑的威慑力还是很强……"],["/interaction_records/15/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412170.json"],["/interaction_records/15/title_i18n/cn","莱卡 & 卡夫拉 & 帕瑞莎"],["/interaction_records/16/preview_i18n/cn","说起来，我还真怀念我上学的时候，最大的烦恼只是怎么学好功课而已。哪像现在……"],["/interaction_records/16/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413020.json"],["/interaction_records/16/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 芙拉贝尔 & 莱卡"],["/interaction_records/17/preview_i18n/cn","我曾听过一句话，“星空中藏着每个人的命运”。"],["/interaction_records/17/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413050.json"],["/interaction_records/17/title_i18n/cn","莱卡 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/18/preview_i18n/cn","诸位，你们有没有觉得月影乡的人对外面有一些……奇怪的认知？"],["/interaction_records/18/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413080.json"],["/interaction_records/18/title_i18n/cn","埃隆 & 莱卡"],["/interaction_records/19/preview_i18n/cn","这是纸鸢尾，这是绿黛兰……喏，漫漫你来闻闻，很香的。"],["/interaction_records/19/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413120.json"],["/interaction_records/19/title_i18n/cn","莱卡 & 漫漫 & 满满"]]}